   "text": "Labels (WSO2 template):  [C-High] highly confidential, [C-Medium] medium.  Arrows are network\ncalls [M-NT], except 3, a port inside the pod.  [B-EX-CP] WSO2 part outside Agentic Engineer.\n[B-EX-EN] outside entity.",
